B.arp=new A.mR("INFORMATION WE COLLECT","We may process your player name, avatar, account identifier, details from your sign-in provider, gameplay progress, XP, achievements, scores, leagues and leaderboard activity. We also process technical and diagnostic information, including device, browser and network details, to maintain the service. Support requests can contain information you provide.",null)
B.arq=new A.mR("HOW INFORMATION IS USED","Information is used to operate First Guess, synchronise progress, manage accounts and leagues, show rankings, provide support, prevent misuse, investigate problems and keep the service secure.",null)
B.arr=new A.mR("DATA RETENTION","We keep account and gameplay data while necessary to provide the service. Account deletion requests aim to remove associated personal gameplay data, subject to lawful retention obligations. Processing a request may take time.",null)
